  "cited_article_id": "create-custom-appointment-types",
  "reply": "If a custom visit type isn’t showing on the booking screen, first verify that the type is enabled for the relevant facility under **Settings > Scheduling > Locations**. If it is enabled there, confirm your user role has the **Manage Appointment Types** permission (Settings > Staff > Roles). Enabling the type for the location or adding the permission will make it visible to patients."
}
